{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5acd62e4c4a1a53deac8","text":"不愧是老板！这次又看穿了我的伪装呢！","speaker":"不动狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ac6c619893f850f3b8e4","text":"马脚还是挺明显的。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b2842bb0ba96c65ff0bb","text":"是说工牌吗？","speaker":"不动狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-8629502890b6907a4ad6","text":"嘿嘿，那是特意给老板您留的线索——不然这游戏玩起来多累啊！","speaker":"不动狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-dd89ae432e1693277832","text":"别提了，累死我了。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-cb086416c8c64ad42343","text":"辛苦老板了！让我给您捏捏肩，捶捶背……","speaker":"不动狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-91165a8f988eb3c96554","text":"…呃，不行，个子太矮了够不到。","speaker":"不动狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-9ff8ff9313ce708dc8e6","text":"你还真是坚持……","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-a42c09c90a08697cd43a","text":"咳咳…总而言之，比起其他喜欢变身的狸狸，只有我「不动狸」是真正爱岗敬业的卧底记者！","speaker":"不动狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-9ce0318340ac95911787","text":"…不然我下次说话就用更多的感叹号！","speaker":"不动狸"}]}
